@c editing_classes_defs.texi — OOPS System and Classes.Defs Format
@node OOPS System
@chapter OOPS System and Classes.Defs

The Object-Oriented Programming System (OOPS) in EIGHTBOL provides a
class-based inheritance model for all game entities. The OOPS system
is defined using a COBOL-like syntax in @file{Classes.Defs}, which
EIGHTBOL compiles to efficient assembly for the target CPU.

